<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EG&amp;G cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EG&amp;G cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Phua Young said he downgraded EG&amp;G Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited company's announcement on Wednesday that it expects earnings for the year to fall short of expectations.</p>
<p>-- Young said he reduced the earnings estimate to range $1.15-$1.20 per share from $1.30 for 1996, and to range $1.30-$1.35 from $1.60 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares dropped 3-1/4 to 17-1/4.</p>
</text>
